Hey, dog, kids. I'm really in charge now.

00:12:51.970 --> 00:12:54.350
The schemer is the boss.

00:12:57.780 --> 00:12:59.980
Okay. Yeah, well...

00:13:01.690 --> 00:13:03.750
Hey, how should I know? Never even heard of the place before.

00:13:03.990 --> 00:13:08.840
Hey, listen, I'm busy here. I don't have time to talk about trains.

00:13:09.200 --> 00:13:16.900
Hey, what do I care? What am I, a walking encyclopedia?

00:13:17.290 --> 00:13:18.230
I got things to do.

00:13:19.390 --> 00:13:21.570
One thing you have to do is call the train dispatcher.

00:13:21.810 --> 00:13:23.010
Remember what Stacy said?

00:13:23.470 --> 00:13:25.330
Yeah, yeah, yeah. First things first, though, huh?

00:13:25.610 --> 00:13:28.190
You're going to be in trouble when Stacy gets back.

00:13:29.010 --> 00:13:29.330
Trouble?

00:13:30.350 --> 00:13:32.570
When Jonesy finds out what I'm doing with this place,

00:13:32.670 --> 00:13:34.050
she's probably going to give me a medal.

00:13:34.400 --> 00:13:35.340
What are you doing?

00:13:36.260 --> 00:13:38.120
I'm going to show Miss Stacy Jones

00:13:38.120 --> 00:13:40.380
how to turn this place into a moneymaker.

00:13:40.600 --> 00:13:42.240
And I got a friend who's going to help me.

00:13:42.400 --> 00:13:44.700
We'll be back shortly, so stay out of trouble.

00:13:44.900 --> 00:13:46.780
You're not supposed to leave us alone like that.

00:13:47.140 --> 00:13:48.220
I promise you I'm Stacy.

00:13:48.480 --> 00:13:49.480
And Grandpa, too.

00:13:50.620 --> 00:13:54.380
Alone? I'm not leaving you alone.

00:13:55.480 --> 00:13:57.200
You are going to be with her,

00:13:57.490 --> 00:13:59.650
and you are going to be with him.

00:14:00.350 --> 00:14:03.470
Why, I've never seen such two un-alone people in my life.

00:14:04.000 --> 00:14:07.240
Okay, so why don't you two of you now go inside Harry's workshop

00:14:07.240 --> 00:14:08.700
and play with some of his junk, okay?

00:14:08.820 --> 00:14:10.780
Go ahead, go ahead, go ahead, go ahead.

00:14:10.900 --> 00:14:16.610
I wish Anastasia was here right now.

00:14:19.220 --> 00:14:21.100
Mr. Conductor, you better be careful.

00:14:21.300 --> 00:14:22.780
Schemer might come in and see you.

00:14:23.120 --> 00:14:26.760
I know, but I'm ready to do battle to protect you kids.

00:14:27.140 --> 00:14:29.970
Let him come, not just...

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:32.790
yet, please. Breaking all his promises.

00:14:33.150 --> 00:14:34.350
He said he... I know.

00:14:34.600 --> 00:14:36.620
